WEBVTT

00:08:56.079 --> 00:09:00.101
He tapped into every emotion
he had and we had,

00:09:00.125 --> 00:09:03.188
and from angerness to happiness,

00:09:03.212 --> 00:09:05.783
to grief and everything in between,

00:09:05.807 --> 00:09:07.347
he knew us.

00:09:07.715 --> 00:09:10.691
He took our history
and turned it into powerful dance.

00:09:10.715 --> 00:09:13.902
He and I overlapped generationally.

00:09:14.509 --> 00:09:16.958
We didn't have to talk
about things so much,

00:09:16.982 --> 00:09:21.458
because we understood implicitly
our shared responsibilities.

00:09:21.482 --> 00:09:23.553
So when he asked me
to take over the company

00:09:23.577 --> 00:09:26.056
before he passed in 1989,

00:09:26.080 --> 00:09:28.834
I felt prepared to carry it forward.

00:09:29.295 --> 00:09:32.413
Alvin and I were like parts
of the same tree.